 runs carries this key too, so read it as the end of a turn only when the next result has num_turns 0."),uuid:p(),session_id:o()}).describe("Generic text banner emitted by the loop \u2014 non-error status lines, hook feedback (e.g. a UserPromptSubmit hook's block reason), slash-command output. Hosts render `content` as plaintext at the given level.")),iZ=f(()=>u({type:T("system"),subtype:T("permission_retry"),content:o(),commands:C(o()).describe("Display names of the commands that were allowed."),uuid:p(),session_id:o()}).describe("@internal Emitted when tool execution retries after a permission-mode change allowed previously-denied commands. REPL renders a 'retrying with <commands>' banner. From internal SystemMessage 'permission_retry'.")),lZ=f(()=>u({type:T("system"),subtype:T("stop_hook_summary"),hook_count:E().int(),hook_infos:C(u({command:o(),prompt_text:o().optional(),duration_ms:E().int().optional()})),hook_errors:C(o()),hook_additional_context:C(o()).optional().describe("Non-error feedback from hookSpecificOutput.additionalContext \u2014 kept separate from hook_errors so the sanctioned feedback channel is not labeled an error. Absent in sessions persisted before this field existed."),prevented_continuation:M(),stop_reason:o().optional(),has_output:M(),level:U(["info","notice","suggestion","warning"]),tool_use_id:o().optional(),hook_label:o().optional(),total_duration_ms:E().int().optional(),uuid:p(),session_id:o()}).describe("@internal Summary of Stop/SubagentStop hook execution at turn end \u2014 which hooks ran, their output, and whether any prevented continuation. From internal SystemMessage 'stop_hook_summary'.")),dZ=f(()=>u({type:T("system"),subtype:T("memory_saved"),written_paths:C(o()),team_count:E().int().optional(),verb:o().optional().describe('Renders as "<verb> N memories". Defaults to "Saved".'),uuid:p(),session_id:o()}).describe("@internal Confirmation that the memory subsystem wrote to the listed paths. REPL renders a '<verb> N memories' banne