id:o()}).describe("@internal Fire-and-forget push from a headless session for one `$.ui.toast(text)`: what the REPL shows on the notification bar under the prompt for a few seconds, under the plugin's name. Be ready for a plugin's toasts at no fixed rate; nothing counts how many a plugin has shown.")),NW=f(()=>u({type:T("system"),subtype:T("ui_status"),plugin:o().describe("@internal The calling plugin's registry name, as the hooks engine knows it (never plugin-settable). One status line per plugin."),text:o().nullable().describe("@internal The plugin's pinned line, replacing its previous one; null removes it. Be ready for up to 10000 characters of it and then an ellipsis. Plain text: draw it as a text node, never as markup."),uuid:p(),session_id:o()}).describe("@internal Fire-and-forget push from a headless session for one `$.ui.status(text)`: the line the REPL pins under the prompt beside the engine's own notices until the plugin's next call replaces or clears it.")),IW=/^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,64}$/,pe=f(()=>o().regex(IW).describe("@internal A pane's id as the plugin opened it (`$.ui.open({ id })`): 1 to 64 of letters, digits, `_`, `-`. What a ui_render for `Pane` carries as `instance_id`.")),PW=f(()=>u({id:pe(),title:o().describe("@internal The pane's tab label: the `title` its latest open gave, else its id. Plugin-authored text the engine bounded and freed of control characters: draw it as a text node, never as markup."),plugin:o().describe("@internal The registry name of the plugin that opened it, as the engine knows it; a `$.ui.scroll` or `$.ui.focus` of the pane is that plugin's alone."),close_on_escape:T(!0).optional().describe("@internal Escape while the pane holds the keyboard, or at an idle empty composer, closes it as the person's close does (send ui_close); absent, Escape only returns the keyboard."),hold_toasts:T(!0).optional().describe("@internal The surface holds its transient toasts while this pane is the one shown, and shows them once it closes."),rows:E(